{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-c-equals-bar-iff-all-1dim","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:c-equals-bar-iff-all-1dim","kind":"proposition","title":"Charge conjugation equals bar involution iff all irreps are one-dimensional","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-lepton-meson-torus-knot-dictionary"],"cites":["references/jones1987","references/wenzl1988c"],"tags":["charge-conjugation","bar-involution","CPT","lepton","meson","standard-representation","matter-antimatter"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.ParticleInteractions.two_only_unit_squares","text":"c-equals-bar-iff-all-1dim.md","leanSource":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/c-equals-bar-iff-all-1dim.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:c-equals-bar-iff-all-1dim\"></a><p><em>On the Iwahori--Hecke algebra <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H_n(q)</code>, charge conjugation <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">C\\colon \\sigma_i \\mapsto \\sigma_i^{-1}</code> and the bar involution <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{bar}\\colon q \\mapsto q^{-1}</code> agree on all irreducible characters if and only if every irreducible representation of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H_n(q)</code> is one-dimensional.</em></p>\n<p><em>At <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H_2(q)</code> (leptons), <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">C = \\mathrm{bar}</code>. At <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H_3(q)</code> (mesons, baryons), <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">C \\ne \\mathrm{bar}</code>.</em></p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/c-equals-bar-iff-all-1dim.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"9.7.2"}
